{"comment":"The app link of Branch Deck: what `branch-deck cli mcp` (brd mcp) writes for each message of air-ide. A runner of the app side starts brd mcp on the fixtures of test-server, sends each line of air-ide and checks each line of the app; ${repo} is the repository of its fixture. A runner of air-ide does not run this file. The lines of the app hold ${any} where a value depends on the fixture."}
